3 ; 49:32 (epithet of Arabian tribes, Herod. iii, 8 WMM As.u.Eur.140 f. We Skizzen iii. 119 ; Heid. 2, 198); temples of Moab (under figure of man) Num 24:17 (JE) Jer 48:45 . 2 side: a. usually of Ezekiel's temple, the tabernacle, the holy city and the land, or its subdivisions (only Ezekiel 41-48 [47 t.] and P [26 t.]): in plur. קָדִ֫ימ(הׅ מְּאַת East side Ezek 47:18 17 t. Ezekiel, = פ ׳קֵדְמָה Exod 27:13 3 t. P and Ezek 45:7 (see Co Toy); פ ׳צָפ֫וֺנ(ה) North side 47:15 ; Exod 26:20 9 t.; פ נ֫גְבָּה) ׳ֶ נֶגֶב South side Ezek 47:19 (twice in verse); Exod 27:9 8 t.; פ ׳(יָ֫מָּה) יָם West side Ezek 45:7 ; Exod 27:12 21 t. + פ ׳הַיָּם דֶּרֶךְֿ Ezek 41:12 (also ׳פ הַיָּם קָדִים 48:1 ); absolute only הָאֶחָת לַמֵּאָה Exod 27:9 . b. מָּנָיו מְּאַת Lev 13:41 side (border) of his face (forehead and temples; P). פאם see פימה","rootNote":"feminine of 6311 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"Amos 3 12","keyReferences":["Amos 3 12","Exod 25 26","Exod 26 18","Exod 26 20","Exod 27 9","Exod 27 9","Exod 27 11","Exod 27 12"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":86,"occurrences":[{"reference":"Amos 3 12","book":"Amos","chapter":3,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בִּ/פְאַ֥ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc"},{"reference":"Exod 25 26","book":"Exod","chapter":25,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/פֵּאֹ֔ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"Exod 26 18","book":"Exod","chapter":26,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לִ/פְאַ֖ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc"},{"reference":"Exod 26 20","book":"Exod","chapter":26,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לִ/פְאַ֣ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc"},{"reference":"Exod 27 9","book":"Exod","chapter":27,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לִ/פְאַ֣ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc"},{"reference":"Exod 27 9","book":"Exod","chapter":27,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"